stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> SelectCredential
  SelectCredential --> SendAttempt: 找到健康 Key
  SelectCredential --> NextTarget: 当前 Endpoint 无可用 Key
  SendAttempt --> Success: 2xx + 正常终态
  SendAttempt --> Cooldown: 429
  SendAttempt --> AuthFailed: 401 / 403
  SendAttempt --> RetryableFailure: 连接错误 / 明确 5xx
  SendAttempt --> TerminalFailure: 4xx 参数错误
  SendAttempt --> StreamCommitted: 已向客户端发送首字节
  Cooldown --> SelectCredential: 标记 cooldown，尝试同 Endpoint 下一 Key
  AuthFailed --> SelectCredential: 标记 auth_failed，尝试下一 Key
  RetryableFailure --> NextTarget: 尝试预算允许
  NextTarget --> SelectCredential: 同协议备用 Target
  NextTarget --> TerminalFailure: 无 Target 或预算耗尽
  StreamCommitted --> TerminalFailure: 禁止换 Key 或 Provider
  Success --> [*]
  TerminalFailure --> [*]
